; Regression: the same failed collapse where its value is BOUND
; (2026-10-04): `let r show twice(3)` is `(show twice)(3)`, and r held nothing
; at rc 0 -- the program printed an empty line. Reported for a binding, an
; explicit return and a body that is one expression; the statement shapes are
; `xfail_parenless_call_last` and `xfail_parenless_chain_dropped`.
;
; Since 2026-10-19 the operation driver refuses the sequence itself
; (Planner.report_unread_operation#); the gate on what the collapse left
; behind is gone with the collapse.
;
; xfail: a call without parentheses takes exactly one thing, and more follows here

function twice(n: int) returns int
    n * 2

function show(n: int) returns int
    n + 1

let r show twice(3)
print "`r`\n"
